                "description": "The Tube Lever with Contemporary 5 Inch Rosette has a modern design with a big presence that is ideal for making a statement on your doors. This Tube Lever with Contemporary Rosette is available in dummy, passage, privacy and keyed entry functions. Choose from your favorite modern finish color option.",
